sequenceDiagram

  %% Request flow — one chat turn end-to-end

  autonumber

  participant Client as Chat client

  participant Route as respond.ts

  participant Ctrl as RespondController

  participant Svc as SurfaceRespondService

  participant Reg as SurfaceSessionRegistry

  participant Pi as Pi AgentSession

  participant LLM as LLM server

  participant FS as Memory workspace

  participant Queue as sqliteTaskQueue



  Client->>Route: POST /v1/respond JSON

  Note over Client,Route: { user_id, message, session_id?, show_thinking? }



  Route->>Route: SSE headers · hijack response

  Route->>Ctrl: handle(body)



  Ctrl->>Ctrl: RespondRequestSchema.safeParse()

  alt invalid body

    Ctrl-->>Route: error validation_error

  else valid

    Ctrl-->>Route: start (request_id, session_id, started_at)

    Ctrl->>Svc: handleTurn(request, context)



    Svc->>Reg: getOrCreate(sessionId, userId)

    alt first turn for session_id

      Reg->>Reg: createSurfaceSession()

      Note over Reg,FS: cwd = user memory dir<br/>tools: read · ls · grep · find<br/>web_search · schedule_task

    end

    Reg-->>Svc: AgentSession



    alt session_busy

      Svc-->>Route: error session_busy

    else ready

      Svc->>Svc: agent/piMessageText.enrichUserMessage (+ timezone now)

      Svc->>Pi: runAgentPrompt(session, message)

      Pi->>LLM: streaming chat completion



      loop Pi session events

        Pi-->>Svc: text_delta · tool events · agent_end

        Svc->>Svc: mapPiEventToRespond()

        Svc-->>Route: delta · tool_call · tool_result · usage · final

        opt agent uses filesystem tools

          Pi->>FS: read / ls / grep / find

          FS-->>Pi: results

        end

        opt agent schedules deferred work

          Pi->>Queue: schedule_task(description)

          Note over Pi,Queue: server builds context.turns<br/>from last N Pi session turns

          Queue-->>Pi: task queued confirmation

        end

      end

    end

  end



  Route->>Route: writeSseEvent() each event · log · close stream

  Route-->>Client: text/event-stream

